#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:210
msgid "Watermark color"
msgstr "Filigrane couleur"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:211
msgid "Color of the footer watermark. Default is black: <code>#000000</code>."
msgstr ""
"Couleur du tatouage pied de page. Valeur par défaut est noir : "
"<code>#000000</code> ."

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:220
msgid "Y Fine Tuning"
msgstr "accord précis"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:221
msgid ""
"Move the footer watermark up and down on the page by adjusting this number. "
"Default is 260 millimeters (bottom of letter-sized page)."
msgstr ""
"Le filigrane de pied de page monter et descendre sur la page en ajustant ce "
"nombre. Valeur par défaut est 260 millimètres (bas de page format lettre)."

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:235
msgid "Leave No Trace?"
msgstr "Ne laisser aucune trace?"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:236
msgid ""
"If this box is checked if/when you uninstall WaterWoo, all your WaterWoo "
